# oh-my-pi (omp). Config root is ~/.config/omp; omp's state, logs, and caches
# resolve under $XDG_*_HOME/omp (~/.local/share/omp, ~/.local/state/omp,
# ~/.cache/omp) and never appear here. Below: artifacts omp generates on its
# own. agent/config.yml (settings) and agent/models.yml are tracked.
omp/install-id
omp/.env
omp/run/
omp/agent/.env
omp/agent/config.yml.lock
omp/agent/config.yml.broken-*
omp/agent/managed-skills/
# Local Jira instance/team config for the jira-ticket-defaults skill. Machine
# specific (field ids, board, lead accountId) — the skill regenerates a neutral
# template when the file is missing, so this never needs to be committed.
omp/agent/skills/jira-ticket-defaults/config.json
